  {
    "id": "2066933374883688910",
    "text": "There’s no right or wrong when it comes to intro animations, but the way we did this at Linear is we animate based on importance.\n\nh1 → description → product → changelog\n\nChangelog sits higher on the page than the product demo, but it’s less important, so it comes in later. https://t.co/9zfQwiZpkx",
