    "id": "2061426518333571576",
    "text": "To get good animations from an AI you need to get good at telling it what you want:\n\n- \"stagger this list of items\"\n- \"make this animation direction-aware\"\n- \"spacial consistency\", \"crossfade\", \"layout animation\", \n\nI made a motion vocabulary for this:\nhttps://t.co/ExAxpr31no https://t.co/SQXn2piA6r",
