  {
    "id": "2043666802404696483",
    "text": "Animation duration should scale with the size of the animated element.\n\nSmall UI elements like dropdowns can feel great under ~200ms.\n\nBut large transitions, like full-screen menus, need more time to avoid feeling abrupt since they feel “heavier”.\n\nHere’s 150ms vs 300ms: https://t.co/0vdcncXVEj",
